{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_title", "source_sha256": "48396ffe70c814393f0a62a61d5b01cc213cbd50ce75c9e4bd1531929eab750d", "ja": "ouverture：カーテシーフラワー", "zh": "ouverture：屈膝礼之花", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f5f9eef0abe7d9968dbafae0d43ea2aed24d694a8f73aaae871850e8a3337d2", "ja": "姉妹の絆は、ずっと消えることはない。\nお姉さまから、妹たちへ……。\n今日も花園に、乙女達の咲い声が響き渡る。", "zh": "姐妹之间的羁绊，永远不会消失。\n从姐姐大人，传向妹妹们……\n今天，少女们的欢声笑语也回响在花园之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1000_030iku", "source_sha256": "a1fdbba14da17f928f106c8e6f20db9855ba30963c13c764e23c581ee51cab8e", "ja": "ミス・ラベンダー……え？\nあ、あずさお姉ちゃん！？", "zh": "薰衣草小姐……咦？\n梓、梓梓姐！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "083f85430a8e264e41ac4d4c667c64e0b8ff63745bee7dd164aef2f8e7e0f223", "ja": "まぁ……♪　やっぱり、育ちゃんね！\nこんなに大きくなって……♪", "zh": "哎呀……♪果然是育呢！\n都长得这么大了……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "f610083f32e498f4070aad6f3fbe46ad614998b40b31e5242e6ff1e6591d45b6", "ja": "あずさお姉さまを、お姉さまと呼んでいいのは私だけ！\n一般の生徒は、ミス・ラベンダーと呼びなさい！", "zh": "能称呼梓姐姐大人为姐姐大人的只有我！\n一般的学生，就给我叫她薰衣草小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1003_010azu", "source_sha256": "860a108130793e7c17ac8258d978637de522d918e0fc6f1771b8121a9f298e11", "ja": "ええ。海美ちゃんは、とってもいい子なの。\nきっと、育ちゃんとも仲良くなってくれると思うわ。", "zh": "嗯。海美是个非常好的孩子。\n我想她一定也能和育好好相处的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8d82d5def735cd800953b88a8638fb00580fbd178bb0a3a85b2fc10efc905d0", "ja": "あの子と、ずっと……じゃあ、\nお姉さまが本当に優しくしたかったのは……。", "zh": "和那孩子，一直……那么，\n姐姐大人真正想要温柔以待的其实是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_503_il_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_503_il_02_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "cc747d37b2a651d1ef05ce65aebacb80f371f8fce2b743cbf64c1a8c270df46d", "ja": "じゃあ、ひとつお願いを聞いてもらえますか？", "zh": "那么，能答应我一个请求吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
